weltuxle n := leidush(lono());
weltuxle f := 1;
keit (weltuxle i := 2; i <= n; i := i + 1) { f := f * i; }
leshdei f;
```

20! = 2432902008176640000, fits in 64-bit (max ~9.2e18). Good.

**t0-fizzbuzz**:

```
weltuxle n := leidush(lono());
keit (weltuxle i := 1; i <= n; i := i + 1) {
    nei (i yeil 15 == 0) { leshdei "FizzBuzz"; }
    wogeish nei (i yeil 3 == 0) { leshdei "Fizz"; }
    wogeish nei (i yeil 5 == 0) { leshdei "Buzz"; }
    wogeish { leshdei i; }
}
```

